OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA band of rain, turning heavy
OL,6,Fat times, moves across England and
OL,7,FWales today, turning brighter and
OL,8,Ffresher after the rain clears. A windy
OL,9,Fafternoon follows with heavy showers
OL,10,Fmoving into the north and a risk of
OL,11,Fthunder.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers ease in the north
OL,14,Ftonight, with clear spells across the
OL,15,Fcountry. Mist and fog patches will
OL,16,Fdevelop in the south, and winds
OL,17,Fstrengthen in the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
