OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FStaying dry for many with
OL,6,Fwarm sunny spells and patchy cloud.
OL,7,FWinds strengthening in the north, with
OL,8,Fcoastal gales developing in northern
OL,9,FScotland. Heavy rain moves into
OL,10,Fnorthwest Scotland later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
